#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:105
#: 7991340686e640b090666bae8a3ecd5f
msgid "The 4 ports are called **/dev/tty-1**, **/dev/tty-2**, **/dev/tty-3** and **/dev/tty-4**. The first port is the one closest to the USB3 connector. The ports proceed counter-clockwise from there. So tty-2 is the one closest to the power connector."
msgstr ""

