#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:352
#: 866b047ec9734d64bb26289881364274
msgid "`This firmware <https://github.com/tridge/ardupilot/tree/hal-qurt/libraries/RC_Channel/examples/RC_UART>`__ will read the UART serial stream and output to the PWM output of the board you use. For example, you could use a Pixracer or Pixhawk board. It is designed to work with this firmware for any ArduPilot compatible board."
msgstr ""

